      "text": "Subscription methods use generic framing: watch, logs, and agent/attach (and run/* equivalents) establish subscriptions via one JSON-RPC result, then use generic event, subscription/cancel, subscription/closed, and $/cancelRequest notifications; no method-specific event/cancel/closed methods exist on the wire."
